      "text": "Skip to content\nMENU\nEVENTS\nABOUT US\nCAREERS\nLOCATIONS\nCONTACT\nA Classic 1950s Themed American Diner\n\nWith our retro newspaper menus, collector cars, hand-spun milkshakes, classic diner cuisine and breakfast all-day, The Sunliner Diner is sure to become your favorite spot to hang out- It’s Guaranteed!  Take a blast to the past with your family and friends, come and see what all the buzz is about- the fun never ends! Visit our Gift Shop to bring your memories of a swell time home with you!\n\nGulf Shores\n\nPigeon Forge\n\nOrange Beach\n\nFollow on Instagram\nGulf Shores\n\nVIEW\nMENU\n\nPigeon Forge\n\nVIEW\nMENU\n\nOrange Beach\n\nVIEW\nMENU\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nCopyright Sunliner Diner © 2025. All Rights Reserved.",
